The compatibility adapter integrates with SGLang v0.5.23 and follows its
logits processing and speculative decoding interfaces. SGLang is licensed
under Apache License 2.0. Upstream source and copyright notices are at
https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/tree/v0.5.23.

SGLang, PyTorch, XGrammar and the NVIDIA CUDA runtime are dependencies.
Model weights and tokenizer files are retrieved from their original publishers.
